{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44842","headline":"酬姚员外见过林下 · 无可","name":"酬姚员外见过林下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扫苔迎五马，莳药过申钟。\n鹤共林僧见，云随野客逢。\n入楼山隔水，滴斾露垂松。\n日暮题诗去，空知雅调重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无可","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}